(10\\lambda -3) & =0 \\\\ \\lambda  & =0,\\frac{3}{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the two Frobenius series solutions are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(x)={\\sum }_{n=0}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}{x}^{n}\\,\\text{and}\\,y(x)={\\sum }_{n=0}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}{x}^{n+3/10},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere the constants ${a}_{n}$ are to be determined separately in each of the two cases.\n\nOf the given options, the correct answer is\n$y(x)={\\sum }_{n=0}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}{x}^{n+3/10}.$" 13194139535663 true] [17592186359975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359976 13194139535663 true] [17592186359975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359977 13194139535663 true] [17592186359975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359978 13194139535663 true] [17592186359975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359979 13194139535663 true] [17592186359975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186359980 13194139535663 true] [17592186359975 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535663 true] [17592186359975 1041 "selection" 13194139535663 true] [17592186359975 1104 #edb/ref 17592186359980 13194139535663 true] [17592186359975 1110 #uuid "82f58078-9047-5de7-92f0-ad19cd0a4c79" 13194139535663 true] [17592186359976 1034 "y(x)={\\sum }_{n=0}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}{x}^{n+3/5}" 13194139535663 true] [17592186359976 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535663 true] [17592186359976 1111 #uuid "9c17eb15-a9ec-5742-b9d6-d377efa68682" 13194139535663 true] [17592186359977 1034 "y(x)={\\sum }_{n=0}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}{x}^{n-3/5}" 13194139535663 true] [17592186359977 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535663 true] [17592186359977 1111 #uuid "c4a326cc-e547-51bf-ac68-1c5c28c97942" 13194139535663 true] [17592186359978 1034 "y(x)={\\sum }_{n=0}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}{x}^{n-3/10}" 13194139535663 true] [17592186359978 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535663 true] [17592186359978 1111 #uuid "2cc63f18-74c3-540a-a6b5-adf5f44efaa2" 13194139535663 true] [17592186359979 1034 "y(x)={\\sum }_{n=0}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}{x}^{n+1/10}" 13194139535663 true] [17592186359979 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535663 true] [1759